# Copy to .env.dev. Do not commit real credentials.
# Optional API overrides; deploy/.env is loaded automatically.
# PostgreSQL connection is generated from deploy/.env POSTGRES_PASSWORD/PORT.
# Configure PG/Redis passwords and ports in deploy/.env, not here.
# Auth__SigningKey is inherited from deploy/.env unless explicitly overridden.
# Registration requires a real configured SMTP server.
# 163 SMTP uses implicit TLS on port 465. Enter a rotated authorization code locally.
# Mail__Host=smtp.163.com
# Mail__Port=465
# Mail__User=notify_newstart@163.com
# Mail__Password=
# Mail__From=notify_newstart@163.com
# Mail__EnableSsl=true
# Designer and payment credentials are optional; unconfigured features fail explicitly.
